### sourcing a config file in sh
#!/bin/sh
source ./settings.conf
>>> SC1091 2:8
>>> SC3046 2:1

### sourcing a config file in dash
#!/bin/dash
source ./settings.conf
>>> SC1091 2:8
>>> SC3046 2:1

### sourcing the null device in busybox is fine
#!/bin/busybox sh
# shellcheck shell=busybox
source /dev/null
>>> none
